   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 672 of the laws of 1993, amending the public\nauthorities law relating to the construction and financing of facilities for\ncertain public libraries, in relation to including The Community Library",
    "basePrintNo": "S6813",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S6813-2023",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §5, Chap 672 of 1993",
    "lawSection": "Public Authorities",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S6813\n\nSPONSOR: OBERACKER\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend chapter 672 of the laws of 1993, amending the public\nauthorities law relating to the construction and financing of facilities\nfor certain public libraries, in relation to including The Community\nLibrary\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nThis bill will designate The Community Library as an eligible public\nlibrary for the purposes of Dormitory Authority of the State of New York\n(DASNY) financing and construction services.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection one of this bill amends the public authorities law, relating to\nthe construction and financing of facilities for certain public\nlibraries, to include The Community Library.\n\nSection two provides the effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThe Community Library, located in the town of Cobleskill, Schoharie\nCounty, is interested in partnering with DASNY to assist the library\nwith its ongoing renovation and expansion project. To that end, The\nCommunity Library has requested this legislation in order to be desig-\nnated as a \"public library\" for DASNY purposes and to receive the requi-\nsite statutory authorization needed to become eligible for special\nfinancing and construction services.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew bill\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS FOR STATE AND LOCAL GOVERNMENT:\n\nNone\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
